# The production image needs only CMakeLists.txt, src/, tests/, js/, scripts/, css/,
# templates/, public/ and migrations/. Keeping everything else out also keeps `az acr build`
# uploads small. public/js, public/css and the .html pages in public hold files generated
# locally; the image builds its own from js/, css/ and templates/.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!src/
!tests/
!js/
!scripts/
!css/
!templates/
!public/
!migrations/
public/js/
public/css/
public/*.html
public/hallinta/*.html
